{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heliocide</strong> is a relentless top-down scrolling action! Arm your shields, lasers, guns, bombs and missiles to defend the solar system from a massive invasion!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928910/extras/3ebbb75485b58594ec82d326c192a5cb.poster.avif?t=1769740461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928910/extras/3ebbb75485b58594ec82d326c192a5cb.webm?t=1769740461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928910/extras/3ebbb75485b58594ec82d326c192a5cb.mp4?t=1769740461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightweight install</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local CO-OP </strong>in the works</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant action:</strong> minimal cutscenes, no pointless dialogue, and no grind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharp graphics</strong>\u00a0with high framerate.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage swarms of enemy drones, agile hunters, and capital ships with unique behaviors, multi-stage destruction patterns, and boss battles at the end of each story act. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to your advantage: impale foes on deadly sky lasers, evade asteroids, refract your beam with crystals, collide large ships into each other, and dispatch wingmen drones to assist you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock special achievements in Hard mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928910/extras/8f4e3a0904d8419b8856adb5effd420a.poster.avif?t=1769740461\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928910/extras/8f4e3a0904d8419b8856adb5effd420a.webm?t=1769740461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928910/extras/8f4e3a0904d8419b8856adb5effd420a.mp4?t=1769740461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WAR ROOM</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A menu screen showing pilot stats and achievements. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 4-act state of war includes 24 missions across six unique sci-fi environments. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a mission and jump straight into your starfighter to engage the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928910/extras/30ceb3583135bd554e9d7edff52ab891.avif?t=1769740461\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTEL VIEW</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive info on upgrade items, starfighter controls, and enemy activity. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you encounter new foes, additional intel unlocks to test your skill in battle simulations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom or random encounter generator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928910/extras/c63fa0fdbf2761ea0126dae7a764f7